                    READ books.txt  
                    REMOVE book with matching ISBN  
                    WRITE remaining books back  
            ELSE  
                CALL library.add_book(title, author, isbn)  
                    APPEND book to books.txt  
        RENDER books.html  
            FORM for adding books (title, author, ISBN)  
            TABLE listing all books with delete buttons  
```
Key Functionality:  
- CRUD operations on books via file I/O (`books.txt`).  
